00:02:26.775 --> 00:02:31.755
uh, input, content things we can find
on the internet or beginner material,

00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:35.235
uh, to move our learning along.

00:02:35.505 --> 00:02:38.715
And we don't spend as much
time talking about output, but

00:02:38.715 --> 00:02:40.095
we all want to get to output.

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:41.985
I want to speak Persian better.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:44.700
What are we going to do?

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.140
First thing twice a week,
I'm going to speak to Sahra.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:51.810
I've already scheduled that in and
we are going to have a subject.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:52.920
So we're not just...

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:59.520
up until now I just arrive and we talk,
uh, Sahra keeps a record of my mistakes

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.440
or vocabulary that I was missing.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.870
She sends me a report, which she records.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:04.980
I review it.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:08.310
And occasionally I go back
and review previous lessons

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:09.870
and that's kind of been it.

