00:03:26.475 --> 00:03:30.375
So with that, I say, okay,
I'm going to prepare for that.

00:03:30.855 --> 00:03:37.875
So what I did was I Googled, uh, first of
all, I convert, you know, the economy of

00:03:37.905 --> 00:03:43.410
Iran, the economy of Turkey, the economy
of Canada, convert that into uh, Persian.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:44.520
I cheat.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.470
I use Google Translate to do that.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:51.600
I put it in the search field
and, uh, I see what pops up.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:58.770
Now typically Wikipedia pops up pretty
quickly and, uh, we have permission to

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:06.420
