are Persian language Wikipedia articles.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:13.140
Uh, I'm going to study those uh, and
Sahra is going to record them for me.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.990
So that gives me some material to
start to focus in on that uh, the,

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.640
