00:04:51.255 --> 00:04:53.055
And so I can learn from those.

00:04:53.715 --> 00:04:56.865
And the agreement I have with
Sahra is that she will decide the

00:04:56.865 --> 00:05:00.914
subject for Tuesdays, and I will
decide the subject for Thursdays.

00:05:01.245 --> 00:05:05.585
So she gave me the subject of the
economy of those three countries.

00:05:06.075 --> 00:05:09.555
And I've decided that I want
to stay with that vocabulary so

00:05:09.555 --> 00:05:10.815
