is closer to C1 or not so close to C1.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:43.260
To me, this is the most uncomfortable
stage we feel we're not getting anywhere.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.000
We feel we can't remember anything.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.730
And yet we're not good enough
to just listen and read.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:53.670
Once we achieve what I consider
to be this B2 stage where, you

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:55.830
know, I can just listen to Persian.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:57.660
I can just talk to people, make mistakes.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:58.200
Doesn't matter.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:58.820
I'm comfortable.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.730
I can watch movies.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.680
